WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:03.090
Every job asks for something different.

00:03.740 --> 00:07.190
Tailoring your resume by hand takes an evening.

00:07.950 --> 00:12.290
With CV Sapiens, paste the job and pick your resume.

00:13.350 --> 00:17.720
You get a tailored resume and a cover letter for that company.

00:18.400 --> 00:20.980
Job match shows what you already cover,

00:21.310 --> 00:22.450
and what's missing.

00:23.100 --> 00:25.230
For the missing ones, it asks you.

00:25.680 --> 00:27.260
It never invents them.

00:27.910 --> 00:30.520
The application lands on your board,

00:30.870 --> 00:32.670
with interview prep for it.

00:34.750 --> 00:37.490
Paste a job. Start free.
